%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'background':'#ffffff','primaryColor':'#ffffff','primaryTextColor':'#000000','lineColor':'#333333'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ship as ship / program
    participant Dash as guiDashboard
    participant Core as guiCore
    participant Panel as panel builder
    participant KOS as kOS GUI runtime
    participant State as flightData / SHIP

    Ship->>Dash: startDashboard(shipName)
    Dash->>Core: createGuiWindow(title, width)
    Core->>KOS: GUI(width) + logo + title
    Dash->>Core: guiAddTabs(window, tabNames)
    loop each row in guiLayout
        Dash->>Panel: buildXxxPanel(tabBox)
        Panel->>Core: guiAddStatusRow / guiAddButton / ...
        Core->>KOS: ADDVBOX / ADDLABEL / ADDBUTTON
        Panel->>Core: registerUpdater(delegate)
    end
    Dash->>Core: showGui()
    Core->>KOS: window:SHOW()
    Dash->>Core: armGuiRefresh(interval)
    Core->>KOS: install one WHEN trigger

    loop every interval while visible
        KOS->>Core: trigger fires -> refreshGui()
        Core->>Panel: updater:CALL()
        Panel->>State: read flightData / SHIP
        Panel->>Core: setWidgetText(name, value)
        Core->>KOS: Label:TEXT = value
    end

    Note over KOS,Panel: user clicks a button
    KOS->>Panel: ONCLICK delegate fires
    Panel->>State: call library action (e.g. outputFlightData)
